				2.822
			</span></i> (Dura-Europus, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμο-πάτωρ</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ορος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				924e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				11.1
			</span></i>.</div>
